                      "properties": {
                        "content": "<div class=\"section-head\"><div><h2 class=\"display\">How it works</h2></div></div><ol class=\"campaign-steps\"><li><span class=\"campaign-step-n\">1</span><h3>Join the list</h3><p>Enter your email and pick the Dancing Goat café you want to visit. That café stays your pick until you change it.</p></li><li><span class=\"campaign-step-n\">2</span><h3>Get one email a week</h3><p>Every Thursday we email you a coupon for that week's single-origin coffee sample. One email, one coupon, nothing else.</p></li><li><span class=\"campaign-step-n\">3</span><h3>Redeem at your café</h3><p>Show the coupon at the bar of your selected café within seven days and drink your 120&nbsp;ml tasting sample. Free, no purchase required.</p></li></ol>"
